              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Moses did not assign any land to the tribe of Levi. He told them that their possession was to be a share of the offerings to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
